    4	
    5	A function `p_n(n: int) -> int` with three implementations and one
    6	composition, each combining a subset of three EDGES.md edges:
    7	
    8	| Mode      | Uses E6.6 | Uses E6.8 | Uses E5.1 | Description                                  |
    9	|-----------|:---------:|:---------:|:---------:|----------------------------------------------|
    10	| `agg`     | ✓         | ✓         | —         | Aggarwal binary search on `pi_lucy(x)`       |
    11	| `bpsw`    | —         | —         | ✓         | BPSW-walk from 2                             |
    12	| `hybrid`  | ✓         | ✓         | ✓         | Aggarwal narrow to width K, then BPSW-walk   |
    13	
    14	`hybrid` is the C4 composition proper; `agg` and `bpsw` are subset
    15	baselines that isolate the contribution of each component.
