    22	- **E6.8 (Dusart bracket width = n):** for `n >= 6`,
    23	  `n(log n + log log n - 1) <= p_n <= n(log n + log log n)`.
    24	  Reference: Dusart 2010, 2018.
    25	- **E5.1 (BPSW correctness ⇒ PRIMES in TC^0):** Strong-MR(2) ∧ Strong-Lucas
